    "source_locator": "200fdfed-26c1-5c25-a310-fc7e92e61b34#page=38",
    "content": "More  exactly, Wu wei is  man's  part;  he  is  to  be  still, quiet  and  passive  so  that  the Way, ultimate  Reality,  the universe of being, may act through him without let or hin­ drance. The first wei is then the part of the Way.  To use more familiar vocabulary, the idea is to !et God be God in you. Toe result, we are assured, is incalculable accomplish­ ment, but it might not be any civilization man has achieved to date.",
